# Embedded Automation for Smart Modular Waste Conversion

## Overview

Embedded Automation for Smart Modular Waste Conversion is an IoT-based smart waste management system designed to improve waste segregation and monitoring. The system automatically classifies waste into biodegradable and non-biodegradable categories using sensors and embedded technologies, helping to reduce environmental pollution and improve waste collection efficiency.

## Problem Statement

Traditional waste management systems rely heavily on manual waste segregation and collection. This often leads to:

* Improper waste disposal
* Overflowing waste bins
* Increased environmental pollution
* Inefficient recycling processes
* Higher operational costs

## Proposed Solution

The proposed system uses IoT and embedded automation to:

* Automatically segregate waste
* Monitor waste bin fill levels in real time
* Send alerts when bins are full
* Enable efficient waste collection
* Support sustainable waste management practices

## Features

* Automatic waste segregation
* Real-time bin monitoring
* Overflow prevention alerts
* IoT-based remote monitoring
* Smart waste collection support
* Environment-friendly waste management

