## Working Principle

1. Waste is deposited into the smart bin.
2. Sensors detect the type and condition of the waste.
3. The ESP32 processes sensor data.
4. Servo motors direct waste into the appropriate compartment.
5. Ultrasonic sensors continuously monitor bin fill levels.
6. Bin status is transmitted through IoT connectivity.
7. Alerts are generated when the bin reaches its threshold level.

